verify: support the compact single profile at 2 or 4 GiB

Keep the compact SQL/API/PHP workload when single-topology services use
4096 MiB, and allow each verifier guest to use 2048 or 4096 MiB independently.
Retain the fixed image, root and tank sizes and existing dynamic accounting.

The services image builder follows configured RAM and runs before guests.
Fresh 4096/4096 admission includes both guests plus assessed margins;
already-live capture admits only its additional margins. Source/artifact
guards remain unchanged, so this does not resize or adopt an old run.
